sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User (Pentester)
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>FE: Isi email & password, klik "Login"
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/login {email, password}
  API->>DB: SELECT user WHERE email = ?
  DB-->>API: Data user (+ password hash)
  API->>API: Verifikasi password (bcrypt)
  alt Kredensial valid
    API->>API: Terbitkan access + refresh token (JWT) & CSRF token
    API-->>FE: 200 OK + Set-Cookie (access, refresh, csrf) + data user
    FE->>FE: Simpan status login
    FE-->>U: Masuk ke dashboard
  else Kredensial salah
    API-->>FE: 401 Unauthorized
    FE-->>U: Tampilkan pesan "email atau password salah"
  end
